# WorldVoxelPaint repository ignore rules
#
# Keep the distributable plugin files (WorldVoxelPaint.uplugin, Source/, Shaders/,
# and any future Config/, Content/, Resources/, or required Build/ directories).

# Generated Unreal/plugin output
**/Binaries/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/

# Local plugin documentation, planning history, and publishing material
**/Docs/
**/DECISION_LOG.md
**/blog-assets/
**/blog-post-*.md
**/*.plan-*.json
**/*.plan-*.jsonl
**/*.plan-*.md

# Planning/assistant extension state
**/.agents/
**/.claude/
**/.codex/
**/.cursor/
**/.openai/

# IDE and editor-local files
**/.idea/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.code-workspace
**/*.sln
**/*.suo
**/*.user
**/*.userprefs
**/*.xcworkspace/
**/*.xcodeproj/

# Compiled binaries, symbols, objects, and packaged/cooked output
**/*.a
**/*.app/
**/*.dll
**/*.dSYM/
**/*.dylib
**/*.exe
**/*.exp
**/*.lib
**/*.modules
**/*.o
**/*.obj
**/*.pak
**/*.pdb
**/*.so
**/*.target
**/*.ucas
**/*.utoc

# Logs, caches, temporary files, and OS metadata
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/Desktop.ini
**/Thumbs.db
